# PAM for the lockscreen. Quickshell can only use `auth` (the rest needs root), so this is all
# of it: pam_unix checks your password. Keep at least one `required` line or PAM fails with an
# unhelpful error.
#
# Fingerprint first, password as the fallback:
#     auth sufficient pam_fprintd.so
#     auth required   pam_unix.so
auth required pam_unix.so
